msgid "Mainstream MCU adaptation and feedback"
msgstr "主流 MCU 接入与平台反馈"

msgid ""
"Use this page to extend an exact STM32 or GD32 part without weakening the "
"common platform. The current iteration adds STM32F103RBT6 and GD32F303RCT6 "
"reference adaptations and extends selected G474, H743 and U575 modes. "
"Implemented source is separate from a passed software candidate. Every "
"applicable physical result remains `not_executed` until connected equipment "
"executes its station plan."
msgstr ""
"使用本页扩展精确的 STM32 或 GD32 料号，同时维护通用平台合同。本轮新增 STM32F103RBT6 和 GD32F303RCT6 "
"参考接入，并扩展 G474、H743 和 U575 "
"的选定模式。源码实现与已通过的软件候选分别记录。在已连接设备实际执行站点计划之前，所有适用的物理结果均保持 `not_executed`。"

msgid ""
"![Current platform responsibilities and external product "
"boundary](../assets/diagrams/platform-architecture.svg)"
msgstr "![当前平台责任与外部产品边界](../assets/diagrams/platform-architecture.svg)"

msgid "Current platform responsibilities and external product boundary"
msgstr "当前平台责任与外部产品边界"

msgid ""
"FIG-01 is the current responsibility diagram, not a claim that every "
"peripheral or family is adapted. Its arrows express dependencies: products "
"consume common interfaces; private SoC providers consume reviewed vendor "
"operations. FIG-03 in [the platform explanation](../explanation/platform-"
"architecture.md) describes TOML, facts, immutable IR, atomic generation and "
"CMake selection. No additional runtime registry, default worker or mandatory"
" OS layer is introduced here."
msgstr ""
"FIG-01 是当前责任图，不表示所有外设或系列均已接入。箭头表达依赖：产品使用公共接口，私有 SoC provider "
"使用经过审查的厂商操作。[平台说明](../explanation/platform-architecture.md)中的 FIG-03 描述 "
"TOML、事实、不可变 IR、原子生成和 CMake 选择。本轮不引入新的运行时注册表、默认工作者或强制 OS 层。"

msgid "Finite parts and reference configurations"
msgstr "精确料号与参考配置"

msgid ""
"The exact-part table defines the adaptation boundary. Source "
"implementations, reviewed chip routes, Board wiring, executed software "
"qualification and physical measurements remain separate facts. Adding one "
"entry does not enable every part with the same family prefix. Current facts,"
" routes and capability derivation remain authoritative; this page is not "
"another completion database."
msgstr ""
"精确料号表规定接入边界。源码实现、受审芯片路线、Board "
"接线、实际执行的软件资格和物理测量分别记录。增加一项不代表启用相同系列前缀下的所有型号。当前事实、路线与能力派生仍是权威；本页不建立另一份完成状态数据库。"

