"IRC8M chip reference with finite peripheral selections and TIMER1/TIMER4 "
"time cascade; no invented PCB"
msgstr "采用 IRC8M 的芯片参考配置，提供有限外设选项和 TIMER1/TIMER4 时间级联；不虚构 PCB"

msgid ""
"The H743 and U575 memory regions are not one interchangeable DMA heap. "
"Consult their exact `soc.json` memory domains and DMA contracts. Likewise, "
"F407 CCM is not ordinary DMA-accessible SRAM; GD32F470 TCM likewise has a "
"separate reachability contract. The GD32F303 RC part deliberately avoids the"
" larger-density code/data Flash split; another density requires its own "
"geometry and executable-memory review."
msgstr ""
"H743 和 U575 的存储区域不能视为可互换的统一 DMA 堆。应查阅精确的 `soc.json` 存储域与 DMA 合同。同样，F407 CCM "
"不是普通的 DMA 可访问 SRAM；GD32F470 TCM 也有独立的可达性合同。GD32F303 选择 RC "
"型号，明确避开更大容量型号的代码/数据 Flash 分离；其他容量需要单独审查几何与可执行存储。"

msgid ""
"NUCLEO-F103RB wiring comes from UM1724 Rev 17: PA5 is D13/user LED LD2, and "
"USART2 PA2/PA3 reaches ST-LINK VCP with SB13/SB14 ON and SB62/SB63 OFF. "
"These are documented reference conditions, not observations of a connected "
"board. The HSI profile does not assume the board's optional HSE or ST-LINK "
"MCO arrangement. GD32F303 pin multiplexing is a chip route until a "
"separately sourced PCB authorizes the connection and electrical conditions."
msgstr ""
"NUCLEO-F103RB 接线来自 UM1724 Rev 17：PA5 对应 D13/用户 LED LD2；SB13/SB14 接通且 "
"SB62/SB63 断开时，USART2 PA2/PA3 连接 ST-LINK VCP。这些是文档参考条件，不是对已连接实板的观察。HSI "
"配置不假设板上可选 HSE 或 ST-LINK MCO 的设置。GD32F303 引脚复用仍属于芯片路线，直到独立来源的 PCB "
"资料授权对应连接和电气条件。"

msgid "Nine I/O classes and explicit rejection"
msgstr "九类 I/O 与明确拒绝"

msgid ""
"This table describes the software scope to inspect, not executed "
"qualification. \"Selected\" always means the controllers, routes and modes "
"declared by the facts and fixtures. \"Outside this increment\" means "
"configuration must reject that selection; a register header or upstream "
"library is insufficient to accept it."
msgstr ""
"本表描述需要检查的软件范围，不代表已经执行的资格。“选定”始终指事实与夹具声明的控制器、路线和模式。“不在本次增量内”表示配置必须拒绝该选择；仅有寄存器头或上游库不足以准入。"

