msgid ""
"CAN, USB, Ethernet, DAC and storage/protocol services are separate "
"capabilities; the nine-class table does not include or qualify them. "
"Unsupported controllers, routes, transfer modes and backends must fail "
"during resolution. They must not fall back from DMA to polling or substitute"
" a different controller or pin. The [derived capability "
"matrix](../delivery/capabilities.md) and the existing [SoC ledger](soc-"
"refinement.md) retain their actual authority."
msgstr ""
"CAN、USB、Ethernet、DAC "
"与存储/协议服务属于独立能力，九类表不包含或授予这些能力资格。不支持的控制器、路线、传输模式和后端必须在解析阶段失败。不得从 DMA 回退到 "
"polling，也不得替换其他控制器或引脚。[派生能力矩阵](../delivery/capabilities.md)与既有 [SoC 台账](soc-"
"refinement.md)继续作为实际权威。"

msgid "Exact mode boundaries"
msgstr "精确模式边界"

msgid ""
"G474 has 52 GPIO pads in the RE package, not six complete sixteen-pin banks."
" The fixed HSE profile reserves PF0/PF1; PG10 remains reserved because its "
"NRST option is not changed. The GPIO inventory is independent of a Board "
"connector route. SPI1/2 use eight-bit transfers, modes 0..3, explicit "
"active-low CS and at most 256 bytes per finite call. The 170 MHz profile "
"caps requested SCK at 42.5 MHz: divider two would exceed the datasheet "
"limit. G474 also implements TIM3 CH1 PA6 AF2 and TIM4 CH1 PB6 AF2 as "
"independent whole-controller PWM owners: fixed upcounting active-high base, "
"integer clock divisor 1..65536, period 1..65535 and staged duty 0..period. "
"Capture, complementary outputs, break, IRQ, DMA and shared timer channels "
"remain outside this increment."
msgstr ""
"G474 的 RE 封装包含 52 个 GPIO 焊盘，不能视为六个完整的十六引脚端口。固定 HSE 配置保留 PF0/PF1；PG10 因 NRST "
"选项保持不变而继续保留。GPIO 清单与 Board 连接器路线分别维护。SPI1/2 使用八位传输、模式 0..3、明确的低有效 "
"CS，每次有限调用最多传输 256 字节。170 MHz 配置将请求 SCK 限制为 42.5 MHz：二分频会超过数据手册上限。G474 还将 "
"TIM3 CH1 PA6 AF2 与 TIM4 CH1 PB6 AF2 实现为独立、独占整个控制器的 PWM 所有者：固定向上计数、有效高电平 "
"base，整数时钟分频 1..65536，period 为 1..65535，暂存 duty 为 "
"0..period。Capture、互补输出、break、IRQ、DMA 及共享 timer channel 均不在本次增量内。"

msgid ""
"Those PWM limits describe counter arithmetic, not unconditional pad "
"frequency. SPI/PWM use OSPEEDR=11. DS12288 Table56 at 30 pF limits pad "
"toggling to 50 MHz at VDD 1.62..2.7 V and 120 MHz at 2.7..3.6 V; the logical"
" 85 MHz waveform at period two is therefore conditional. The current profile"
" does not establish GPIO supply, load or pulse suitability; Board "
"qualification must do so."
msgstr ""
"这些 PWM 限制描述计数器算术范围，不表示无条件的引脚频率。SPI/PWM 使用 OSPEEDR=11。DS12288 Table56 在 30 pF"
" 下，将引脚翻转限制为 VDD 1.62..2.7 V 时 50 MHz、2.7..3.6 V 时 120 MHz；因此 period 为二时的逻辑 "
"85 MHz 波形有适用条件。当前配置不建立 GPIO 供电、负载或脉宽适用性；这些条件必须由 Board 验证。"

msgid ""
"Polling SPI returns only after wire drain and inactive CS are proved. If a "
"post-admission reset or CS withdrawal cannot prove that state, the executor "
"retains the caller buffers and controller/CS owners, masks interrupts and "
"calls the platform fault observer. It parks if the observer returns; "
"external product recovery must not return into released storage. Idle "
"stop/recovery failures retain their separate retryable private leases."
msgstr ""
"Polling SPI 仅在证明移位器排空且 CS 无效后返回。若准入后的 reset 或 CS "
"撤回不能证明这一状态，执行者保留调用者缓冲及控制器/CS "
"所有者，屏蔽中断并调用平台故障观察者。观察者返回后继续停驻；外部产品恢复不得返回已释放的存储。空闲 stop/recovery "
"失败仍保留各自可重试的私有租约。"

msgid ""
"H743 USART3 uses PD8/PD9 AF7 and normal, finite RX DMA blocks on DMA1 "
"Stream1, DMAMUX1 channel 1 request 45. The owner services completion and "
"rearms the next block; gaps are possible. This is not a circular or "
"continuous receiver. Only the selected initialized AXI/SRAM1 domains are "
"admitted. Cache-off blocks contain 1..65535 bytes. Cache-on blocks own "
"complete, exclusive 32-byte cache lines, with aligned address and length and"
" a maximum length of 65504 bytes. Source withdrawal, stable remaining count "
"and post-invalidation precede publication. A borrowed consumer or failed "
"detach retains the stream, cache and platform dependencies."
msgstr ""
"H743 USART3 使用 PD8/PD9 AF7，以及 DMA1 Stream1 上普通模式的有限 RX DMA 块，DMAMUX1 channel"
" 1 request 45。所有者负责处理完成并重新装载下一个块；块之间可能出现空隙。这不是循环或连续接收器。仅准入选定且已初始化的 AXI/SRAM1"
" 域。Cache 关闭时，块包含 1..65535 字节。Cache 开启时，块必须独占完整的 32-byte Cache "
"行，地址和长度均须对齐，最大长度为 65504 字节。必须先撤离访问源、观察稳定的剩余计数并完成后置 Cache "
"失效操作，才能发布。消费者仍持有借用，或分离失败时，必须继续保留 DMA 流、Cache 及平台依赖。"

msgid ""
"U575 adds USART2 PA2/PA3 AF7 and package-valid GPIO routes. PG[15:2] require"
" an already established VDDIO2 supply and observed PWR clock/IO2SV "
"configuration; the platform does not enable an unknown external rail. IO2SV "
"is a configuration observation, not a measurement of rail voltage. TZEN0 "
"remains the general platform profile. The separate TZEN1 reference also "
"accepts cooperative GPIO jobs of at most eight PC7 commands copied into one "
"Secure slot. SERVICE advances at most one command, POLL reads latched "
"status, CANCEL preserves earlier effects and CONSUME releases only a "
"terminal job. Tickets never wrap; no NS address survives a call. This "
"provides neither a user-buffer loan nor general asynchronous or cross-"
"security transport support."
msgstr ""
"U575 新增 USART2 PA2/PA3 AF7 以及适用于该封装的 GPIO 路由。PG[15:2] 要求 VDDIO2 供电已经建立，并观察到 "
"PWR 时钟／IO2SV 配置；平台不会使能未知的外部电源轨。IO2SV 是配置观察结果，不是电源轨电压测量。TZEN0 仍是通用平台配置。独立的 "
"TZEN1 参考配置还接受至多包含八条 PC7 命令的协作式 GPIO 作业，命令会复制到一个 Secure 槽位中。SERVICE "
"每次最多推进一条命令，POLL 读取锁存状态，CANCEL 保留此前已产生的效果，CONSUME "
"仅释放已进入终态的作业。票据永不回绕；调用结束后不保留任何 NS 地址。这既不提供用户缓冲区借用，也不提供通用异步或跨安全域传输支持。"

msgid ""
"F103 uses USART2 PA2/PA3 and PA0/PA1 EXTI events. F103 SPI1 and GD303 SPI0 "
"use default PA5/PA6/PA7 with explicit PA4 active-low CS, nominal 31.25 "
"kHz..4 MHz, eight-bit words, modes 0..3 and at most 256 bytes per finite "
"call. Their SPI assemblies cannot also select the PA5 GPIO/LED binding. F103"
" TIM2 is 16-bit at a nominal 1 MHz; its overflow service and mask interval "
"must stay below 65.536 ms. GD303 cascades TIMER1 update TRGO into TIMER4 "
"ITI0 and extends the high overflow, with a service interval below 2^32 "
"nominal microseconds. This preserves low wraps across the stated 800 ms "
"Flash erase bound; the timer-bridge carry propagation still needs physical "
"observation. Neither profile establishes calibrated wall time or FreeRTOS "
"tick catch-up after same-bank fetch stalls."
msgstr ""
"F103 使用 USART2 PA2/PA3 和 PA0/PA1 EXTI 事件。F103 SPI1 和 GD303 SPI0 使用默认的 "
"PA5/PA6/PA7，以及显式指定、低电平有效的 PA4 CS；标称频率为 31.25 kHz..4 MHz，字长为八位，支持模式 "
"0..3，每次有限调用最多传输 256 字节。它们的 SPI 装配不能同时选择 PA5 GPIO/LED 绑定。F103 TIM2 为 "
"16-bit，标称频率为 1 MHz；其溢出服务间隔和中断屏蔽时长均须小于 65.536 ms。GD303 将 TIMER1 更新 TRGO 级联到 "
"TIMER4 ITI0，并扩展高位溢出，服务间隔须小于 2^32 个标称微秒。这使低位计数在所述 800 ms Flash "
"擦除上限期间发生的回绕仍可保留；定时器桥接的进位传播仍需物理观察。两个配置都不建立经过校准的实际时间，也不证明同 bank 取指停顿后的 "
"FreeRTOS tick 追赶。"

msgid "Mode resources, acquisition and physical Flash"
msgstr "模式资源、采集与物理 Flash"

msgid ""
"F103 USART2 uses DMA1 channel7 for TX and channel6 for finite RX; GD303 "
"USART0 uses DMA0 channel3/channel4. TX-only construction has the compact TX "
"state and explicit IRQ-byte ring; duplex alone adds caller-supplied RX "
"blocks. Both admit only declared SRAM spans of 1..65535 bytes. Memory TC "
"does not settle TX before wire TC and source withdrawal. Finite RX publishes"
" only after channel/DMAR withdrawal and stable count; owner service rearms a"
" free block, so gaps and visible loss remain part of the contract. An "
"unavailable replacement never authorizes overwriting a consumer loan. Their "
"PB6/PB7 I2C uses priority-zero IRQ handling and rejects kernel "
"notifications; bus voltage and pull-ups are external. The shared legacy "
"engine remains the sole protocol owner."
msgstr ""
"F103 USART2 的 TX 使用 DMA1 channel7，有限 RX 使用 channel6；GD303 USART0 使用 DMA0 "
"channel3/channel4。仅 TX 的构造采用紧凑的 TX 状态与显式的 IRQ 字节环形缓冲区；只有双工构造才增加调用者提供的 RX "
"块。两者仅准入已声明、长度为 1..65535 字节的 SRAM 区间。在传输线 TC 和访问源撤离之前，内存 TC 不会使 TX 结清。有限 RX "
"仅在通道／DMAR "
"撤离且计数稳定后发布；所有者服务重新装载空闲块，因此空隙和可见丢失仍属于合同的一部分。替换块不可用绝不授权覆盖消费者借用的存储。它们的 PB6/PB7 "
"I2C 使用优先级为零的 IRQ 处理，并拒绝内核通知；总线电压与上拉由外部负责。共享的旧式引擎仍是唯一的协议所有者。"

msgid ""
"G474 ADC1 selects single-ended 12-bit bulb sampling, SYSCLK/128 = 1.328125 "
"MHz and sample code0. Software shots discard the first conversion and keep "
"their explicit warmup and spacing guards. TIM6 finite normal-DMA blocks "
"accept only 2.5–50 kHz rates that divide the 1 MHz trigger timebase exactly."
" Bulb aperture depends on the preceding EOC and next trigger, not SMPR "
"alone. IRQ stops the trigger; service observes DMA/ADC withdrawal and ADEN "
"clear before publication, then a later service rearms. The admitted SRAM1/2 "
"domain excludes CCM aliases even though silicon can DMA through its "
"0x20018000 alias. The 32 KiB CCM counts once. See [the exact G474 "
"contract](stm32g474.md) for errata and aperture bounds."
msgstr ""
"G474 ADC1 选择单端 12-bit bulb 采样，SYSCLK/128 = 1.328125 MHz，采样代码为 "
"code0。软件触发的单次采样丢弃首次转换，并保留显式的预热与间隔保护。TIM6 触发的有限普通模式 DMA 块仅接受能整除 1 MHz 触发时基的 "
"2.5–50 kHz 采样率。bulb 采样孔径取决于前一次 EOC 和下一次触发，而非仅由 SMPR 决定。IRQ 停止触发；服务先观察到 "
"DMA/ADC 已撤离且 ADEN 已清零，再发布，随后由后续服务重新装载。准入的 SRAM1/2 域排除 CCM 别名，即便芯片可通过其 "
"0x20018000 别名执行 DMA。32 KiB CCM 只计入一次。勘误和采样孔径界限见[确切的 G474 合同](stm32g474.md)。"

msgid ""
"H743's optional D2 SRAM1 has explicit budgeting, gate admission and startup "
"DATA/BSS initialization; NOINIT stays caller-owned. DMA rechecks initialized"
" AXI/SRAM1 and clock state before borrowing. H743 ADC1 provides 16-bit raw "
"shots on PA3/INP15 with cut-specific boost and complete linearity "
"calibration; U575 ADC4 provides 12-bit PC0/channel1 shots after external "
"VDDA/ASV admission. F103/GD303 use 12-bit PA0/channel0 shots at 4 MHz, with "
"part-specific warmup and calibration. These formats and declared reference "
"voltages are not measured analog accuracy. Their exact selected PWM/EXTI "
"routes and pin conflicts remain in [support](../delivery/support.md) and the"
" adjacent SoC contracts."
msgstr ""
"H743 的可选 D2 SRAM1 具有显式预算、时钟门控准入和启动时 DATA/BSS 初始化；NOINIT 仍由调用者拥有。DMA 在借用前重新检查"
" AXI/SRAM1 已初始化及其时钟状态。H743 ADC1 在 PA3/INP15 上提供 16-bit 原始单次采样，并采用与芯片修订版本匹配的 "
"boost 配置和完整线性度校准；U575 ADC4 在满足外部 VDDA/ASV 准入条件后，提供 PC0/channel1 12-bit "
"单次采样。F103/GD303 在 4 MHz 下使用 PA0/channel0 12-bit "
"单次采样，并采用型号专属的预热与校准。这些格式和已声明的参考电压不代表经测量的模拟精度。它们确切选定的 PWM/EXTI "
"路由和引脚冲突仍由[支持范围](../delivery/support.md)及相邻的 SoC 合同规定。"

msgid ""
"Physical Flash exposes the whole exact part, not a product partition. "
"Authored `supply_mv` is a mandatory software assumption where required, "
"never a voltage measurement. `nx_flash_geometry_t.program_flags` can set "
"`NX_FLASH_PROGRAM_REQUIRES_FRESH_ERASE`: each unit needs a successful erase "
"and no later programming pulse. All-FF readback cannot prove hidden ECC "
"history; failed/interrupted pulses consume the unit until its next "
"successful erase. Providers keep no implicit history bitmap. Zero flags do "
"not waive a provider's own programming rules, and all-FF input units issue "
"no pulse."
msgstr ""
"物理 Flash 暴露确切型号的完整空间，而不是产品分区。在要求提供的场景中，编写配置时指定的 `supply_mv` "
"是必需的软件假设，绝不是电压测量。`nx_flash_geometry_t.program_flags` 可设置 "
"`NX_FLASH_PROGRAM_REQUIRES_FRESH_ERASE`：每个单元都须经过一次成功擦除，且此后未承受任何编程脉冲。全 FF "
"的读回结果不能证明隐藏的 ECC "
"历史；失败或中断的脉冲会消耗该单元的编程资格，直至下一次成功擦除。提供者不保留隐式历史位图。标志为零不免除提供者自身的编程规则，全 FF "
"的输入单元也不会触发脉冲。"

msgid ""
"Every physical pulse first clears and observes stale error/completion state,"
" then requires fresh completion after its actual busy/write-buffer drain. "
"G474, U575 and F407 gate EOP latching with EOPIE; GD470 uses ENDIE for its "
"end flag. Their polling owner exclusively leases a disabled/inactive FLASH "
"IRQ while selected pulse interrupt bits are temporarily set; the NVIC never "
"enables that vector. Cleanup removes pulse mode/enables, locks and observes "
"pending withdrawal while preserving priority. Legacy F103/GD303 and H743 "
"completion flags latch unconditionally under their register contracts; the "
"interrupt-enable precondition is not inferred for them. H743 drains "
"BSY/QW/WBNE and requires Cache off; U575 drains BSY/WDW in TZEN0/SWAP0."
msgstr ""
"每次物理脉冲前，先清除残留的错误／完成状态并观察清除结果，再要求在实际忙状态／写缓冲排空后出现新的完成状态。G474、U575 和 F407 的 EOP"
" 锁存受 EOPIE 控制；GD470 的结束标志使用 ENDIE。在临时置位选定的脉冲中断位期间，它们的轮询所有者独占租用处于禁用、非活动状态的 "
"FLASH IRQ；NVIC "
"始终不使能该向量。清理时撤除脉冲模式和使能位、锁定控制器，并在保留优先级的同时确认挂起状态已经清除。按各自的寄存器合同，旧式 F103/GD303 和 "
"H743 的完成标志无条件锁存；不能据此推断它们也具有中断使能前置条件。H743 等待 BSY/QW/WBNE 排空，并要求 Cache "
"off；U575 在 TZEN0/SWAP0 下等待 BSY/WDW 排空。"

msgid ""
"Timeout prevents a later pulse but cannot abort one already started. Same-"
"bank fetch/IRQ can stall, and a permanently busy controller never returns "
"caller storage as completed. Product code owns writable erase-aligned "
"regions, voltage, watchdog, execution placement and power-loss recovery. The"
" common Flash adapter does not invent erase history. The maintained two-bank"
" storage algorithm erases the inactive bank before a save, writes distinct "
"full header/payload units and programs a separate commit unit last; a failed"
" save requires reopen/recovery before a later save erases that target again."
msgstr ""
"超时会阻止后续脉冲，但无法中止已经启动的脉冲。同 bank 的取指／IRQ "
"执行可能停顿；若控制器永久保持忙状态，就始终不能按“已完成”归还调用者存储。产品代码负责可写且擦除对齐的区域、电压、watchdog、执行位置和掉电恢复。通用"
" Flash 适配器不会虚构擦除历史。维护中的双 bank 存储算法在保存前擦除非活动 "
"bank，分别写入不同的完整头部／载荷单元，并最后编程一个独立的提交单元；保存失败后，必须先重新打开／恢复，后续保存才能再次擦除该目标。"

msgid ""
"Watchdog activation is irreversible, including a programming failure after "
"the start command. Preparation failures retain any unwithdrawn LSI or debug "
"lease for stop retry. Programmed nominal duration is distinct from physical "
"minimum and maximum duration. GD303 and F470 datasheets provide nominal "
"internal RC frequency without a reviewed min/max envelope: successful "
"programming returns success with zero bounds; an enabled state query reports"
" unsupported bounds while preserving enabled, irreversible and actual debug "
"facts. U575 rejects prescaled LSI and requires a nominal minimum of 375 "
"microseconds so RLR is at least two. Bounds from every other part retain "
"their own datasheet conditions."
msgstr ""
"看门狗激活不可逆，启动命令之后的编程失败也不例外。准备失败会保留未成功撤回的 LSI 或 debug 租约，供 stop "
"重试。已编程的标称时长与物理最短、最长时长分别记录。GD303 与 F470 数据手册提供内部 RC 标称频率，没有受审的最小/最大包络：编程成功返回 "
"success，边界为零；已启用状态查询报告不支持边界，同时保留 enabled、irreversible 和实际 debug 事实。U575 "
"拒绝预分频 LSI，标称最小时长为 375 微秒，确保 RLR 至少为二。其他芯片的边界均保留各自数据手册的适用条件。"

msgid "Official sources and version pairing"
msgstr "官方来源与版本配对"

msgid ""
"Manufacturer documents establish silicon facts. Libraries supply selected "
"operations; examples help identify ordering but do not establish a universal"
" platform contract. Retain the original notices and license inventory, lock "
"exact bytes or Git commits, and include the selected source closure in the "
"Source SDK. Official PDF URLs can change; a future download must match the "
"recorded digest or undergo a new review."
msgstr ""
"厂商文档建立芯片事实。库提供选定操作；示例可帮助识别执行顺序，但不建立通用平台合同。必须保留原始声明与许可证清单，锁定精确字节或 Git "
"提交，并将所选源码闭包纳入 Source SDK。官方 PDF URL 可能变化；后续下载必须匹配已记录摘要，或重新审查。"

