msgstr ""
"[分别处理 GD32 旧式与 AF GPIO 布局](https://github.com/zephyrproject-"
"rtos/zephyr/blob/dccb09599635bdff17633fa7e9dab014b91dce90/drivers/gpio/gpio_gd32.c#L176)"

msgid ""
"Model CTL0/CTL1 and MODER/AFR separately; preload output state before "
"enabling its mode"
msgstr "分别建模 CTL0/CTL1 与 MODER/AFR；启用输出模式之前预装输出电平"

msgid ""
"[AFIO remap belongs to the pin set](https://github.com/zephyrproject-"
"rtos/zephyr/blob/dccb09599635bdff17633fa7e9dab014b91dce90/drivers/pinctrl/pinctrl_gd32_afio.c#L179)"
msgstr ""
"[AFIO remap 属于整组引脚](https://github.com/zephyrproject-"
"rtos/zephyr/blob/dccb09599635bdff17633fa7e9dab014b91dce90/drivers/pinctrl/pinctrl_gd32_afio.c#L179)"

msgid ""
"Validate shared remap conflicts during generation; do not treat legacy remap"
" as independent per-pin AF"
msgstr "在生成阶段验证共享 remap 冲突；不得将旧式 remap 视为独立的逐引脚 AF"

msgid ""
"[UART obtains its actual peripheral clock](https://github.com/zephyrproject-"
"rtos/zephyr/blob/dccb09599635bdff17633fa7e9dab014b91dce90/drivers/serial/uart_stm32.c#L231)"
msgstr ""
"[UART 取得实际外设时钟](https://github.com/zephyrproject-"
"rtos/zephyr/blob/dccb09599635bdff17633fa7e9dab014b91dce90/drivers/serial/uart_stm32.c#L231)"

msgid ""
"Use resolved bus/kernel clock facts for baud calculation; do not assume CPU "
"frequency"
msgstr "使用已解析总线/内核时钟事实计算波特率；不假设等于 CPU 频率"

msgid ""
"[UART TX uses peripheral TC](https://github.com/zephyrproject-"
"rtos/zephyr/blob/dccb09599635bdff17633fa7e9dab014b91dce90/drivers/serial/uart_stm32.c#L1788)"
msgstr ""
"[UART TX 使用外设 TC](https://github.com/zephyrproject-"
"rtos/zephyr/blob/dccb09599635bdff17633fa7e9dab014b91dce90/drivers/serial/uart_stm32.c#L1788)"

msgid "Keep DMA completion, wire completion and final settlement distinct"
msgstr "区分 DMA 完成、线上完成与最终结算"

msgid ""
"[DMA buffer cache restrictions](https://github.com/zephyrproject-"
"rtos/zephyr/blob/dccb09599635bdff17633fa7e9dab014b91dce90/drivers/serial/uart_stm32.c#L1936)"
msgstr ""
"[DMA 缓冲的 cache 限制](https://github.com/zephyrproject-"
"rtos/zephyr/blob/dccb09599635bdff17633fa7e9dab014b91dce90/drivers/serial/uart_stm32.c#L1936)"

msgid ""
"Reject an unsupported memory domain or implement explicit whole-cache-line "
"ownership and maintenance"
msgstr "拒绝不支持的存储域，或实现明确的整缓存行所有权与维护"

msgid ""
"[DMA rejects unsupported block shape](https://github.com/zephyrproject-"
"rtos/zephyr/blob/dccb09599635bdff17633fa7e9dab014b91dce90/drivers/dma/dma_gd32.c#L355)"
msgstr ""
"[DMA 拒绝不支持的 block 形式](https://github.com/zephyrproject-"
"rtos/zephyr/blob/dccb09599635bdff17633fa7e9dab014b91dce90/drivers/dma/dma_gd32.c#L355)"

msgid ""
"Reject unsupported chaining, widths and address adjustments before retaining"
" references"
msgstr "保留引用之前拒绝不支持的链式、宽度与地址调整"

msgid ""
"Nexus does not copy mandatory kernel integration, workqueues, device PM or "
"runtime discovery into the default MCU path. An upstream driver may have a "
"different timeout, cancellation or buffer-return contract. Retain Nexus "
"absolute deadlines and the accepted-borrow contract; reusing register "
"operations must not introduce a second transfer owner. Preserve upstream "
"notices when copying code; an architectural comparison does not itself "
"import source."
msgstr ""
"Nexus 不把强制内核集成、工作队列、设备 PM 或运行时发现复制到默认 MCU 路径。上游驱动的超时、取消或缓冲归还合同可能不同。必须保留 "
"Nexus 绝对 deadline 与接受借用合同；复用寄存器操作不得引入第二个传输所有者。复制代码时保留上游声明；架构比较本身不导入源码。"

msgid "Adaptation must improve the shared platform"
msgstr "接入必须完善共享平台"

msgid ""
"For every new part, first identify exact differences: register generation, "
"clock/reset domains, interrupt topology, DMA routing, cache reachability, "
"package pins, errata and irreversible effects. Put those facts in the SoC "
"description and reviewed routes. Keep PCB electrical facts in Board data and"
" product policy in external repositories. A compiler define cannot "
"substitute for this review."
msgstr ""
"每个新料号首先识别精确差异：寄存器代际、时钟/复位域、中断拓扑、DMA 路线、缓存可达性、封装引脚、勘误和不可逆效果。将这些事实写入 SoC "
"描述与受审路线。PCB 电气事实保留在 Board 数据，产品策略保留在外部仓库。一个编译宏不能代替这些审查。"

msgid ""
"Use an existing provider only where its hardware and ownership assumptions "
"hold. Extract a common mechanism after two concrete adaptations demonstrate "
"identical semantics and failure ordering. Prefer compile-time helpers or "
"shared production algorithms with private hardware ports; avoid forwarding-"
"only runtime layers, family-name condition chains and descriptors that "
"merely duplicate generated constants. Measure code, RAM and stack before "
"accepting a generalization."
msgstr ""
"只有硬件和所有权假设成立时才复用既有 provider。在两个具体接入证明语义与失败顺序相同之后，再抽取通用机制。优先使用编译期 "
"helper，或带私有硬件端口的共享生产算法；避免仅转发的运行时层、系列名称条件链及重复生成常量的描述符。接受泛化前，必须测量代码、RAM 和栈。"

msgid ""
"The new legacy GPIO adaptations should feed back package validation, atomic "
"set/reset, output-before-mode ordering and remap conflict handling. Their "
"UARTs should feed back clock rounding, live-device rejection, IRQ mask "
"restoration, error/data ordering and late-interrupt isolation. F103 TIM2 is "
"16-bit, unlike the F407 32-bit TIM2: an overflow extension requires an "
"explicit maximum service gap and cannot silently reuse the longer wrap "
"assumption."
msgstr ""
"新增旧式 GPIO 接入应反馈完善封装验证、原子置位/复位、先输出后模式的顺序及 remap 冲突处理。对应 UART "
"应反馈完善时钟舍入、活动设备拒绝、IRQ mask 恢复、错误/数据读取顺序和晚到中断隔离。F103 TIM2 为 16 位，与 F407 的 32 位"
" TIM2 不同：overflow 扩展必须有明确的最大 service 间隔，不能静默沿用更长的回绕假设。"

msgid ""
"This iteration applies that feedback to timer admission and cleanup: recheck"
" retained slave, channel and trigger state after observing the timer gate; "
"keep a gate-only lease separate from an admitted timer; and select a quiet "
"trigger source while issuing the prescaler update. A refused reset, trigger "
"restore or gate withdrawal retains the corresponding cleanup responsibility."
" Watchdog reviews likewise propagate status-safe observation, conservative "
"mixed shadow update bounds and retryable preparation cleanup without "
"assuming identical RC or reload semantics across vendors."
msgstr ""
"本轮将反馈用于 timer 准入和清理：观察 timer gate 后重新检查保留的 slave、channel 和 trigger 状态；将仅 "
"gate 租约与已准入 timer 分开；发出预分频更新时选择安静的 trigger 源。reset、trigger 恢复或 gate "
"撤回遭拒时，保留对应清理责任。看门狗审查同样反馈完善基于状态的安全观察、保守的混合 shadow 更新边界和可重试准备清理，不假设不同厂商拥有相同 RC"
" 或 reload 语义。"

msgid ""
"Actual library behavior must be reviewed, including hidden effects: GD32F4's"
" combined `fwdgt_config` starts the irreversible counter before programming."
" Treating that call as reversible preparation is invalid. Likewise, new M3 "
"images use soft-float while existing M4F images use hard-float. Resource, "
"retention, candidate and reproducibility tools obtain ABI from the sole "
"resolved CPU contract and still validate ELF flags, linked configuration and"
" input bytes; they never infer ABI from an artifact to make it pass."
msgstr ""
"必须审查库的实际行为，包括隐藏副作用：GD32F4 的组合函数 `fwdgt_config` "
"在编程前启动不可逆计数器，将其视为可逆准备是不成立的。同样，新增 M3 映像使用 soft-float，既有 M4F 映像使用 hard-"
"float。资源、保留、候选与复现工具从唯一的 resolved CPU 合同取得 ABI，并继续验证 ELF "
"flags、链接配置和输入字节；绝不根据制品推断 ABI 来使其通过。"

msgid ""
"Official LL helpers are reviewed operations, not automatically bounded code."
" For example, F1 `ATOMIC_*` USART setters may contain exclusive-store retry "
"loops. Use bounded register operations inside the provider's existing saved-"
"mask region where required; keep safe LL data/flag operations private. "
"Errata review must consider the selected mode and silicon revision, "
"including GD32F30x USART DMA enable ordering, timer capture DMA/shadow "
"interaction and ADC clock constraints."
msgstr ""
"官方 LL helper 是受审操作，不自动意味着执行有界。例如，F1 的 `ATOMIC_*` USART setter 可能包含 "
"exclusive-store 重试循环。必要时在 provider 既有的保存/恢复 mask 区域中使用有界寄存器操作；安全的 LL "
"数据/标志操作仍保持私有。勘误审查必须考虑选定模式与芯片修订，包括 GD32F30x USART DMA 使能顺序、timer capture "
"DMA/shadow 相互作用和 ADC 时钟约束。"

msgid "Acceptance sequence and next admissions"
msgstr "验收顺序与后续接入"

msgid ""
"Each adaptation follows the same sequence: source/license review; failing "
"configuration and real-provider tests; minimal implementation; passing "
"tests; strict resource/mode rejection; ARM image/resource checks; relocated "
"SDK consumption; and clean-source candidate qualification. Preserve the "
"actual RED failure and GREEN commands. GoogleTest/GoogleMock remain host-"
"only; firmware remains C11 and allocation-free by default. The "
"[qualification contract](../delivery/qualification.md) defines the evidence "
"requirements rather than the number of files or checks in this page."
msgstr ""
"每项接入采用相同顺序：来源/许可证审查；失败的配置与真实 provider 测试；最小实现；测试通过；严格资源/模式拒绝；ARM "
"映像/资源检查；搬移后的 SDK 消费；clean-source 候选资格。保留真实 RED 失败与 GREEN "
"命令。GoogleTest/GoogleMock 仅用于主机，固件保持 C11 "
"且默认无动态分配。[资格合同](../delivery/qualification.md)规定证据要求，而不是本页的文件或检查数量。"

msgid ""
"Exercise partial start failure, retry, reverse cleanup, instance isolation, "
"accepted cancellation, late IRQ and failed drain wherever the selected mode "
"can reach them. A failed drain retains `QUARANTINED` storage; a timeout "
"never revokes the borrow. Only acquire-observed `SETTLED`, after required "
"references detach, ends the provider's access. The caller still drains its "
"observers and controls."
msgstr ""
"凡选定模式可能到达的路径，均需执行部分启动失败、重试、逆序清理、实例隔离、接受后的取消、晚到 IRQ 和排空失败。排空失败保留 "
"`QUARANTINED` 存储；超时从不撤销借用。只有所需引用脱离后，以 acquire 观察到 `SETTLED`，才结束 provider "
"访问。调用者仍需排空自己的 observer 和控制引用。"

msgid ""
"The physical station separately observes chip/revision, Board/bridges, "
"clock, image, reset and I/O behavior. Performance statements require the "
"same image, clock, workload and instrument. Host test time and operation "
"counts are not MCU cycles, IRQ latency, electrical correctness or safety "
"qualification. Record hardware-dependent exits as pending while no equipment"
" is connected."
msgstr ""
"物理站点独立观察芯片/修订、Board/焊桥、时钟、映像、复位和 I/O 行为。性能结论要求相同映像、时钟、工作量和仪器。主机测试耗时与操作计数不等于 "
"MCU cycles、IRQ latency、电气正确性或安全资格。没有设备连接时，依赖硬件的退出条件保持待执行。"

msgid ""
"Further mainstream candidates include STM32F072RBT6, STM32F303RET6, "
"STM32G071RBT6, STM32L476RGT6 and GD32E230F8P6. These are proposed admission "
"targets, not supported parts. Confirm official package/memory facts, source "
"licenses, toolchain/ABI, a finite peripheral set and a separately sourced "
"Board before implementation. Other GD32F4xx and STM32F4 parts likewise need "
"explicit variant facts and routes; neither an SDK header nor matching core "
"grants support."
msgstr ""
"后续主流候选包括 STM32F072RBT6、STM32F303RET6、STM32G071RBT6、STM32L476RGT6 和 "
"GD32E230F8P6。这些是建议的接入目标，不是已支持料号。实施前需确认官方封装/存储事实、源码许可证、工具链/ABI、有限外设集合及独立来源的 "
"Board。其他 GD32F4xx 和 STM32F4 料号同样需要明确的变体事实与路线；SDK 头或相同内核均不授予支持。"

msgid ""
"Bootloader handoff, runtime reclocking, deep STOP, generic cross-domain DMA "
"and broader U575 asynchronous transport retain their separate exits in the "
"[SoC refinement ledger](soc-refinement.md). This iteration does not close "
"those tasks by adding an MCU family or linking an official library."
msgstr ""
"Bootloader 接管、运行时变频、deep STOP、通用跨域 DMA 与更广的 U575 异步 transport 仍遵循 [SoC "
"完善台账](soc-refinement.md)中的独立退出条件。本轮不会因增加一个 MCU 系列或链接官方库而关闭这些任务。"

msgid ""
"F103 standalone admission checks the CPU-readable factory Flash density, not"
" a debug-only device-group or revision value. ES096 Rev15 section2.2.2 "
"reports zero from normal-software DBGMCU reads; group and revision therefore"
" remain unobserved. The configured STM32F103RBT6 declaration and package "
"still require separate integration evidence. See the [F103 source "
"boundary](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/stm32f103/README.md)."
msgstr ""
"F103 独立启动准入检查 CPU 可读的工厂 Flash 密度，不依赖仅调试模式可读的设备组或修订值。ES096 Rev15 第 2.2.2 "
"节指出，正常软件读取 DBGMCU 返回零，因此设备组和修订仍未观察。配置中的 STM32F103RBT6 料号声明及封装仍需独立接入证据。参见 "
"[F103 来源边界](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/stm32f103/README.md)。"

#: ../../nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/mainstream-mcu-adaptation.md:0
msgid ""
"H743 SPI4 and U575 SPI1 finite polling; separate H743 V-revision HSI64 "
"baremetal finite SPI4 DMA with Cache off/on"
msgstr ""
"H743 SPI4 与 U575 SPI1 有限轮询；独立 H743 V 修订、HSI64、裸机有限 SPI4 DMA（Cache off/on）"

#: ../../nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/mainstream-mcu-adaptation.md:85
msgid ""
"The optional Ethernet contracts also remain distinct. The original `eth` "
"face uses contiguous untagged frames and four-word descriptors. The separate"
" [`eth_frames` selection](ethernet-frames.md) uses eight-word descriptors, "
"scatter-gather frame loans, one in-band VLAN C-tag and MAC hardware-event "
"timestamps on exact F407/F470 RMII references. They cannot own the same MAC "
"simultaneously. Neither contract includes a protocol stack or network clock "
"synchronization, and software composition does not qualify PHY/PCB wiring."
msgstr ""
"可选 Ethernet 合同也分别维护。原有 `eth` face 使用连续未标记帧和四字 descriptor。独立 [`eth_frames` "
"选择](ethernet-frames.md)在精确 F407/F470 RMII 参考上使用八字 descriptor、SG frame "
"loan、单个带内 VLAN C-tag 和 MAC 硬件事件时间戳；两者不能同时占用同一个 "
"MAC。两个合同都不包含协议栈或网络时钟同步，软件装配也不为 PHY/PCB 接线建立资格。"

#: ../../nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/mainstream-mcu-adaptation.md:93
msgid ""
"H743 SPI4 DMA selects DEV_ID `0x450`, REV_ID `0x2003` (V), fixed "
"HSI64/default trim, Cache off/on and baremetal. Its normal finite full-"
"duplex requests borrow non-overlapping TX/RX spans in selected initialized "
"AXI SRAM. Cache off accepts 1..65535 bytes; Cache on requires exclusive "
"complete 32-byte lines with aligned addresses and lengths of 32..65504 "
"bytes. DMA1 Stream2/3 remain separate from optional USART3 Stream0 TX or "
"Stream1 RX. PLL384, FreeRTOS, 16-bit, fixed dummy/discard and multisegment "
"SPI DMA are outside that mode. See the [H743 provider "
"contract](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/stm32h743/README.md)."
msgstr ""
"H743 SPI4 DMA 选择 DEV_ID `0x450`、REV_ID `0x2003`（V）、固定 HSI64/默认 trim、Cache "
"off/on 和裸机。正常有限全双工请求借用所选已初始化 AXI SRAM 中互不重叠的 TX/RX span。Cache off 接纳 "
"1..65535 bytes；Cache on 要求独占完整 32-byte lines，地址对齐，长度为对齐的 32..65504 "
"bytes。DMA1 Stream2/3 与可选 USART3 Stream0 TX 或 Stream1 RX 资源独立。该模式不开放 "
"PLL384、FreeRTOS、16-bit、固定 dummy/discard 或多段 SPI DMA。见 [H743 provider "
"合同](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/stm32h743/README.md)。"

#: ../../nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/mainstream-mcu-adaptation.md:0
msgid ""
"Fixed HSI/cache, finite USART3 DMA, optional initialized D2 SRAM1 and "
"selected finite peripheral fixtures; separate V-revision HSI64 baremetal "
"SPI4 DMA and continuous USART3 double-buffer RX with Cache off/on; Cache-off"
" PLL384 references"
msgstr ""
"固定 HSI/Cache、有限 USART3 DMA、可选且已初始化的 D2 SRAM1 与所选有限外设夹具；另有 V 修订 HSI64 裸机 SPI4"
" DMA 和连续 USART3 双缓冲 RX，均支持 Cache off/on；PLL384 参考保持 Cache off"

#: ../../nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/mainstream-mcu-adaptation.md:0
msgid ""
"TZEN0 finite peripherals, selected USART1 GPDMA TX, finite hardware-chain TX"
" or bounded FIFO IRQ bytes; separate pinless LPTIM2 RUN one-shot and TZEN1 "
"scalar GPIO/copied cooperative jobs"
msgstr ""
"TZEN0 有限外设、所选 USART1 GPDMA TX、有限硬件链 TX 或有界 FIFO IRQ bytes；另有无引脚 LPTIM2 RUN "
"单次计数及独立 TZEN1 scalar GPIO／复制式协作 job"

#: ../../nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/mainstream-mcu-adaptation.md:0
msgid ""
"H743 USART3 IRQ, finite DMA TX/RX-IDLE and separate V/HSI64 baremetal "
"continuous double-buffer RX; U575 USART1/2 IRQ bytes, selected finite USART1"
" GPDMA TX or hardware-chain TX; both families have separate bounded FIFO IRQ"
" selections"
msgstr ""
"H743 USART3 IRQ、有限 DMA TX/RX-IDLE 及独立 V/HSI64 裸机连续双缓冲 RX；U575 USART1/2 IRQ "
"bytes、所选有限 USART1 GPDMA TX 或硬件链 TX；两系列均有独立有界 FIFO IRQ 选择"

#: ../../nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/mainstream-mcu-adaptation.md:114
msgid ""
"U575 USART1 `dma-tx` selects TZEN0, MSIS4, 8N1, Cache off and finite "
"nonsecure SRAM1 payloads through GPDMA1 channel0/request25. IRQ-byte RX "
"remains independent. The [GPDMA contract](u575-uart-gpdma.md) preserves "
"ES0499 persistent DMAT, separate UART wire TC and full source/IRQ/publisher "
"drain. The independent [`irq-fifo-bytes` selection](uart-fifo.md) has "
"explicit thresholds and per-IRQ RX/TX byte budgets; it does not combine with"
" DMA. These selections do not add USART2 DMA/FIFO, RX DMA, LPDMA, TrustZone "
"transport or autonomous low-power execution."
msgstr ""
"U575 USART1 `dma-tx` 选择 TZEN0、MSIS4、8N1、Cache off，并通过 GPDMA1 "
"channel0/request25 处理非安全 SRAM1 中的有限 payload；IRQ-byte RX 保持独立。[GPDMA "
"合同](u575-uart-gpdma.md)保留 ES0499 持续 DMAT、独立 UART 线上 TC 及完整 "
"source/IRQ/publisher 排空。独立 [`irq-fifo-bytes` 选择](uart-fifo.md)有显式阈值和每次 IRQ "
"RX/TX 字节预算，不与 DMA 组合。这些选择不增加 USART2 DMA/FIFO、RX DMA、LPDMA、TrustZone "
"transport 或自主低功耗执行。"

#: ../../nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/mainstream-mcu-adaptation.md:123
msgid ""
"The separate U575 `dma-chain-tx` mode uses the same USART1/GPDMA channel and"
" independent IRQ-byte RX. One request borrows a contiguous SRAM1 payload, up"
" to three blocks of at most 65535 bytes, and at most two packed 12-byte "
"private nodes. The 24-byte node array is 32-byte aligned within one CLBAR "
"window. The 196605-byte protocol limit also requires actual reachable, "
"nonaliasing RAM; it does not reserve the whole SRAM for the caller. Payload "
"and nodes remain live until fetch/channel/IRQ drain and independently "
"observed UART TC. This finite selection does not enable scatter-gather or "
"cyclic chains."
msgstr ""
"独立 U575 `dma-chain-tx` 模式使用同一 USART1/GPDMA channel 及独立 IRQ-byte "
"RX。一次请求借用连续地址的 SRAM1 payload，最多三块，每块最多 65535 bytes，并使用最多两个 packed 12-byte "
"私有节点。整个 24-byte 节点数组按 32 bytes 对齐，位于同一 CLBAR 窗口。196605-byte 协议上限还要求真实可达且无别名的"
" RAM；它不为调用者保留整块 SRAM。payload 和节点保持 live，直到 fetch/channel/IRQ 排空且独立 UART TC "
"已观察。该有限选择不开放 scatter-gather 或循环链。"

#: ../../nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/mainstream-mcu-adaptation.md:132
msgid ""
"The independent pinless U575 LPTIM2 `irq-counter16-oneshot` reference "
"selects TZEN0, MSIS4, baremetal and PCLK1/4 for a nominal 1 MHz RUN counter."
" Requests accept 2..65536 ticks; one tick is rejected because ARR must "
"exceed reset CCR0. IRQ68 priority5 never calls the OS. It owns no external "
"pin or DMA and does not promise Stop, backup or VBAT continuity. PCB and "
"silicon revision remain unobserved; software model and link checks do not "
"measure physical timing."
msgstr ""
"独立无引脚 U575 LPTIM2 `irq-counter16-oneshot` 参考选择 TZEN0、MSIS4、裸机与 PCLK1/4，提供名义 "
"1 MHz RUN counter。请求接受 2..65536 ticks；ARR 必须大于 reset CCR0，因此拒绝一个 tick。IRQ68 "
"priority5 从不调用 OS。它不拥有外部引脚或 DMA，不承诺 Stop、backup 或 VBAT 连续性。PCB "
"与硅片修订仍未观察；软件模型与链接检查不测量物理时序。"

#: ../../nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/mainstream-mcu-adaptation.md:102
msgid ""
"The separate H743 `rx-dma-continuous` mode uses USART3, DMA1 "
"Stream1/request45, DBM/CIRC and at least three equal caller-owned AXI SRAM "
"buffers. It selects the V revision, fixed HSI64, baremetal and Cache off/on."
" Task service replaces the inactive bank before a conservative "
"BRR/TIM2-derived deadline and performs Cache maintenance outside the IRQ. A "
"late or uncertain replacement, cache failure or no FREE buffer stops "
"production with visible loss; loans remain until actual drain. IDLE closes "
"this producer and publishes its drained prefix; a caller must explicitly "
"reinitialize the stream before restarting. TX remains finite IRQ, not DMA "
"duplex. Cache-on buffers own complete aligned 32-byte lines. The mode "
"accepts 32..65535-byte Cache-off buffers or 32..65504-byte Cache-on buffers."
" It does not establish measured throughput, deadline or physical "
"qualification."
msgstr ""
"独立 H743 `rx-dma-continuous` 模式使用 USART3、DMA1 Stream1/request45、DBM/CIRC "
"及至少三个等长、调用者拥有的 AXI SRAM 缓冲区。它选择 V 修订、固定 HSI64、裸机和 Cache off/on。task service "
"在 BRR/TIM2 推导的保守时限之前替换 inactive bank，并在 IRQ 外执行 Cache 维护。替换过晚或不确定、Cache "
"失败或没有 FREE 缓冲区时，停止生产并显式报告 loss；借用保持到实际排空。IDLE 关闭本次 producer 并发布排空后的 "
"prefix；调用者须显式重新初始化 stream 再启动。TX 仍是有限 IRQ，不构成 DMA duplex。Cache-on 缓冲区独占完整对齐的"
" 32-byte lines。该模式接纳 32..65535-byte Cache-off 缓冲区或 32..65504-byte Cache-on "
"缓冲区，不建立实测吞吐、时限或物理资格。"
